<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Account Deleted - Todo-it</title>
    <style>
      /* Reset styles for email clients */
      body, table, td, p, a, li, blockquote {
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }
      table, td {
        mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
        mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
      }
      img {
        -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
        border: 0;
        height: auto;
        line-height: 100%;
        outline: none;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      
      /* Import handwritten font */
      @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gloria+Hallelujah&display=swap');
      
      /* Main styles */
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        width: 100% !important;
        min-width: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f9ff 0%, #e0f2fe 100%);
        font-family: 'Gloria Hallelujah', 'Comic Sans MS', 'Marker Felt', 'Trebuchet MS', cursive, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #1f2937;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      
      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.3);
      }
      
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c757d 0%, #495057 100%);
        padding: 40px 30px;
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
      }
      
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      }
      
      .header p {
        margin: 10px 0 0 0;
        font-size: 18px;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }
      
      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
      }
      
      .greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #333333;
      }
      
      .message {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        color: #555555;
      }
      
      .confirmation-info {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e9ecef 0%, #f8f9fa 100%);
        border: 2px solid #6c757d;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      
      .confirmation-info h2 {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        color: #495057;
        font-size: 24px;
      }
      
      .deletion-details {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #6c757d;
      }
      
      .deletion-details h3 {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        color: #333333;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      
      .deletion-details p {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #666666;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      .data-info {
        background-color: #d1ecf1;
        border: 1px solid #bee5eb;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      
      .data-info h3 {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        color: #0c5460;
        font-size: 16px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }
      
      .data-info h3::before {
        content: "💾";
        margin-right: 10px;
        font-size: 18px;
      }
      
      .data-info p {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #0c5460;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      .recovery-info {
        background-color: #fff3cd;
        border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      
      .recovery-info h3 {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        color: #856404;
        font-size: 16px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }
      
      .recovery-info h3::before {
        content: "⚠️";
        margin-right: 10px;
        font-size: 18px;
      }
      
      .recovery-info p {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #856404;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      .feedback-section {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #f3e5f5 100%);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      
      .feedback-section h2 {
        margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        color: #333333;
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      
      .feedback-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 16px;
        margin: 15px 0;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      }
      
      .feedback-button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
      }
      
      .footer {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      }
      
      .footer p {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #666666;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      .footer a {
        color: #6c757d;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      
      .footer a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      
      .support-info {
        background-color: #e3f2fd;
        border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      }
      
      .support-info h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px 0;
        color: #1976d2;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      
      .support-info p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #555555;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      
      /* Mobile responsiveness */
      @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        .email-container {
          margin: 0;
          border-radius: 0;
        }
        
        .header, .content, .footer {
          padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
          font-size: 28px;
        }
        
        .feedback-button {
          display: block;
          margin: 15px 0;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header">
        <h1>👋 Account Deleted</h1>
        <p>We're sorry to see you go</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">
          Hi there,
        </div>
        
        <div class="message">
          <p>We're writing to confirm that your <%= @app_name %> account has been successfully deleted as requested.</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Confirmation Info -->
        <div class="confirmation-info">
          <h2>Account Deletion Confirmed</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #495057;">Your account and all associated data have been permanently removed from our systems.</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Deletion Details -->
        <div class="deletion-details">
          <h3>Deletion Details</h3>
          <p><strong>Account Email:</strong> <%= @user_email %></p>
          <p><strong>Deleted on:</strong> <%= @deletion_time %></p>
          <p><strong>App:</strong> <%= @app_name %></p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Data Info -->
        <div class="data-info">
          <h3>What was deleted</h3>
          <p>• Your user account and profile information</p>
          <p>• All your pages and todos</p>
          <p>• Your theme preferences and settings</p>
          <p>• Any trial or download data</p>
          <p>• All personal data associated with your account</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Recovery Info -->
        <div class="recovery-info">
          <h3>Important: Data Recovery</h3>
          <p>Please note that this action is permanent and cannot be undone. We cannot recover your deleted data.</p>
          <p>If you had the app downloaded to your device, your local data may still be available there.</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Feedback Section -->
        <div class="feedback-section">
          <h2>Help Us Improve</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #666666;">We'd love to hear about your experience with <%= @app_name %>. Your feedback helps us make the app better for everyone.</p>
          <a href="mailto:feedback@todo-it.app?subject=Account Deletion Feedback" class="feedback-button">Share Your Feedback</a>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Support Section -->
        <div class="support-info">
          <h3>Need Help or Have Questions?</h3>
          <p>If you have any questions about this deletion or need assistance with anything else, please contact us at <a href="https://todo-it.app/contact">support@todo-it.app</a>.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="message">
          <p>Thank you for using <%= @app_name %>. We hope you found it helpful during your time with us!</p>
          
          <p>If you ever change your mind, you're always welcome to create a new account and start fresh.</p>
          
          <p>Best regards,<br>
          The <%= @app_name %> Team</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p><strong><%= @app_name %></strong> - Your personal productivity companion</p>
        <p>This confirmation was sent to <%= @user_email %> (your deleted account email).</p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://todo-it.app/contact">Contact Support</a> | 
          <a href="https://todo-it.app">Visit Website</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
